+    /**
+     * The same kind of monster killed this bot again. Live residents died over and over on one spot to monsters that
+     * are not aggressive (kima, Orc Fighter 4: 22 deaths to Goblin Grave Robbers and Elder Prairie Keltir; AianamiRei,
